<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00589">
	<title>Resuming Smart Cruise Control</title>
	<conbody>
		<table frame="none" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc_none" id="e04238">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="FormatA">
				<colspec colnum="1" colname="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colnum="2" colname="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="1" colsep="0">
							<fig id="e04239">
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/OOV055008_3.eps" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>To resume Smart Cruise Control after the function was canceled, operate the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_334.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" scale="15" id="e04240"/>), (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_335.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" scale="15" id="e04241"/>) or (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_079.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" scale="15" id="e04242"/>) switch.</p>
		<p>If you push the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_334.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" scale="15" id="e04243"/>) switch up or (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_335.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" scale="15" id="e04244"/>) switch down, the set speed will be set to the current speed on the cluster.</p>
		<p>If you press the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_079.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" scale="15" id="e04245"/>) switch, vehicle speed will resume to the preset speed.</p>
		<note type="warning">
			<p>Check the driving condition before using the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_079.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" scale="15" id="e04246"/>) switch. Driving speed may sharply increase or decrease when you press the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_079.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" scale="15" id="e04247"/>) switch.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
</concept>